    "notes": "<div class=\"o-metadata__file-usage-entry\">Optical recordings of &gt;11,000 RGCs<div class=\"o-metadata__file-description\">The dataset contains recordings of 11,210 retinal ganglion cells from the mouse retina obtained by two-photon calcium imaging with the synthetic calcium indicator OGB-1 to a standardized set of stimuli (see Baden et al. 2016 for details). In addition, the dataset contains morphological, genetic and immunohistochemical metadata, where available.</div><div class=\"o-metadata__file-name\">BadenEtAl_RGCs_2016_v1.mat<br></div><div class=\"o-metadata__file-name\"></div></div>"
